msgstr "Dy kolom befettet wachtwurden of tokens, dus der kin net yn socht wurde."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2022
msgid "This site holds too many credentials for Minn to check a value search against, so values cannot be searched here."
msgstr "Dizze side hat te folle oanmeldgegevens foar Minn om in sykopdracht nei wearden tsjin te kontrolearjen, dus wearden kinne hjir net socht wurde."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2124
